    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Personne ne sait si cette Ultra-Chimère venue d’un autre monde montre ses muscles pour être admirée ou pour intimider ceux qu’elle rencontre.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This Ultra Beast appeared from another world. It shows off its body, but whether that display is a boast or a threat remains unclear.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "別世界から　現れた　ＵＢ。 自らの　身体を　みせつけてくるが 自慢なのか　いかくなのか　不明。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "L’une des mystérieuses Ultra-Chimères. On l’aurait aperçue réduisant un camion à benne en miettes d’un seul coup de poing.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "A mysterious life-form called an Ultra Beast. Witnesses saw it pulverize a dump truck with a single punch.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "謎の　生物　ＵＢ。　一発の パンチで　ダンプカーを　粉砕する 光景が　目撃　された。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Cette créature venue d’ailleurs est dangereuse dans notre monde, mais il semblerait qu’elle soit très commune dans le sien.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Although it’s alien to this world and a danger here, it’s apparently a common organism in the world where it normally lives.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "この世界では　異質で　危険だが 本来　棲んでいる　世界では 普通に　見かける　生物らしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ce type d’Ultra-Chimère adore exhiber ses muscles gonflés à l’extrême.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Buzzwole goes around showing off its abnormally swollen muscles. It is one kind of Ultra Beast.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "異常な　までに　膨張する 筋肉を　見せつけてきた。 ウルトラビーストの　一種。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
